text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817D773 {
    "Er-hem! I am the CHAIRMAN of the\nPOKéMON FAN CLUB!\pBeing the CHAIRMAN, I am naturally\nthe most important!\pNo one could best me when it comes\nto raising POKéMON. No one!\pIn any CONTEST, my victory is a\nforegone conclusion!\pBut, that would deprive others of\ntheir enjoyment.\pSo, I now while away my time\nexamining the POKéMON of others.\pIt is marvelous to witness how\nothers have raised POKéMON.\pThe contented faces of properly\nraised POKéMON...\pThe kind and loving gazes of their\nTRAINERS...\pMy heart is overwhelmed - there is\nso much happiness.\pOh, my! Excuse me! I seem to have\nnattered on far too long!\pPlease, do allow me to examine your\nPOKéMON and see how it’s grown."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DA14 {
    "How is your POKéMON growing?\nAllow me to examine it."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DA49 {
    "Hm, hm...\nI see..."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DA5C {
    "Hmmm... It’s not bad, but it’s not\ngood, either...\pYou, the TRAINER, must put more\neffort into raising this POKéMON!\pFor instance, may I suggest that\nyou give it more オカキクケS?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DB0B {
    "Oh, my...\pYour POKéMON is growing quite well,\nso you deserve a reward.\pUnfortunately, you have no space for\nthis in your BAG."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DB89 {
    "Your {STR_VAR_1}, it is growing in\na most impressive manner!\lIt is one fine specimen!\pBut! If you were to give it this,\nit would grow even better! Indeed!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DC1B {
    "Let a POKéMON hold that RED SCARF.\pEveryone will recognize the coolness\nof that POKéMON!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DC74 {
    "Let a POKéMON hold that BLUE SCARF.\pIts beauty will be accentuated much\nmore than now!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DCCB {
    "Let a POKéMON hold that PINK SCARF.\pIt will draw out the cuteness of\nthe POKéMON some more!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DD27 {
    "Let a POKéMON hold that GREEN SCARF.\pThat will enhance the\nsmartness of POKéMON!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DD78 {
    "Let a POKéMON hold that YELLOW SCARF.\pIt will bolster your POKéMON’s\ntoughness so much more!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DDD5 {
    "I’m sorry, but I’ve nothing else to\ngive you! None at all!\pAfter all, you’re blessed with the gift\nof raising POKéMON without resorting\lto any items!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DE6B {
    "I love seeing POKéMON that love\ntheir TRAINERS.\pPOKéMON are very sensitive to the\nfeelings of their TRAINERS.\pIf you treat your POKéMON with love\nand care, they’ll love you back.\pWhen your POKéMON grow to love you,\nplease come show me."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DF57 {
    "Your POKéMON really adores you.\pFor you, a most compassionate\nTRAINER, a gift from the FAN CLUB!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817DFB8 {
    "POKéMON are very sensitive to the\nfeelings of their TRAINERS.\pIf you treat your POKéMON with love\nand care, they’ll love you back."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817E03B {
    "If you keep letting a POKéMON faint\nin battle, it’ll come to resent it.\pSoon, it will become less trusting\nof the TRAINER.\pIn other words, it certainly won’t\nlike you very much."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817E0ED {
    "Do POKéMON enjoy having items used\non them?\pMine acted really happy when I gave\nit some PROTEIN."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817E14E {
    "SKITTY: Fffnyaaaah..."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817E164 {
    "ZIGZAGOON: Kyuuu..."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_0817E178 {
    "AZUMARILL: Marimari?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_081A82F1 {
    "Wow!\pIt’s plain to see that you lavish your\nlove on your {STR_VAR_1}.\pOkay, it’s named {STR_VAR_2}.\pCan I ask you a favor?\pI’m a TV reporter, and I’m running\na survey on POKéMON.\pWould you be willing to answer a few\nsimple questions for me?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_081A83D0 {
    "Great! Thank you!\pOkay, here goes.\nI just need quick answers, okay?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_081A8414 {
    "When you first met {STR_VAR_1}, what\ndid you feel?\pHow would you describe your feelings\nat the time?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_081A8470 {
    "Your {STR_VAR_1} is cared for lovingly.\pIf you were to liken it to something\nthat you like, what would it be?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_081A84D5 {
    "This question also relates to your\nbeloved {STR_VAR_1}.\pWhat was it about {STR_VAR_1} that\nattracted you?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_081A852D {
    "Okay, that makes sense.\pThe next question might be a little\non the tough side.\pHere goes...\pWhat do POKéMON mean to you?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_081A85A6 {
    "I see!\pHmhm...\pOkay!\nThanks for helping me out.\pIt was fun and enlightening chatting\nwith you.\pIt’s possible that our interview will end\nup on TV. Tune in and check!\pOkay, that’s all.\nBye-bye!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_081A8667 {
    "Oh, okay...\pWell, if you get the urge to tell me\nabout POKéMON, I’ll be here!"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_081A86B5 {
    "I enjoy this job - you get to learn so\nmuch about POKéMON by doing\linterviews."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_081A8704 {
    "Hi, you seem to be very close to your\n{STR_VAR_1}.\pDo you know what?\nI’m a TV reporter.\pI travel around interviewing people\nabout POKéMON.\pI’m wondering if you’d be willing to tell\nme a little abut your {STR_VAR_1}?"
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_081A87CA {
    "Wow, thank you!\pOkay, then, please tell me anything you’d\nlike about your {STR_VAR_1}."
}

text Naranja_IslaMurcott_G09_M05_Text_081A8818 {
    "Wow...\nThat’s an interesting account.\pYou really are tight with {STR_VAR_1},\naren’t you?\pI get the feeling that your account\nwill make a great TV story.\pI promise that I’ll turn this into\nan entertaining show.\lKeep your eyes out for it.\pOkay, that’s all.\nBye-bye!"
}
